{"id":"vod_sn_35956","vodId":"35956","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"巨人族的新娘","name_cn":"巨人族的新娘","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5270c9bdaec4ce6084a9e1619afe3331.jpg"},"summary":"水树晃一（伊东健人 配音）是公认的大高个，180cm的身高让他无论身处何地都是最显眼的那一个。一次偶然之中，晃一竟然被名为凯乌斯（小野友树 配音）的男子召唤到了巨人国之中，身高250cm的凯乌斯一见到晃一就发出暴言，希望晃一能够成为他的新娘，并且为他繁衍子嗣。就这样，晃一在巨人国里开始了他的新生活。　　美蒂娜（藤本教子 配音）是凯乌斯原定的未婚妻，哪知道被半路杀出的晃一给抢了王后的位置，因此对晃一总是充满了敌意。巨人国并未一直处于和平状态，隔壁兽人国的巴罗（中泽匡智 配音）和贝利（白井悠介 配音）一直虎视眈眈。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":9,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/659T3yA7pi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KnFEtVh19p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/49dvLUzk5B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E9TzpVvDnk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jfnS5dEe8W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dLjXBqhVSM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Z35cVw6X5X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iDuxz2194P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LGJKtVX1bt1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:28.849Z"}